1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,960
When family expectations make it hard to know what you want,
Harmonise gives you private room to think before you decide.

2
00:00:10,139 --> 00:00:14,539
You can talk, browse, or leave the question unanswered.

3
00:00:18,319 --> 00:00:25,179
He starts with one sentence. The reply is a prepared local
example; no model is connected.

4
00:00:34,523 --> 00:00:38,968
A possible reading appears. It is a draft, not a verdict.

5
00:00:39,842 --> 00:00:43,561
He can choose Not quite, then Edit in my words.

6
00:00:43,761 --> 00:00:49,131
He replaces it with what he means: room to think before deciding
what to say.

7
00:00:51,882 --> 00:00:57,962
His corrected words appear. He confirms what fits, then chooses to
hear experiences.

8
00:01:05,094 --> 00:01:10,219
The family path follows his choice; it is not an automatic model
rewrite.

9
00:01:16,458 --> 00:01:21,563
Ravi's fictional story shares one pressure and shows where their
lives differ.

10
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:37,590
Ravi accepts replies in the group only, with no private-message
option. Arjun reviews the exact audience, alias, and question;
consent remains unchecked, and nothing is sent.

11
00:01:45,814 --> 00:01:51,289
Ravi's response is a prepared illustrative sample, not a live
message.

12
00:01:55,180 --> 00:02:03,425
Later, Dev asks a fictional question. Arjun can share one bounded
part of what he tried, including what went badly.

13
00:02:07,366 --> 00:02:14,341
The private conversation is excluded. This local example is not
published or visible to other people.

14
00:02:17,565 --> 00:02:25,447
Professional support is separate. No directory or credential
checks are connected; no provider is verified or bookable here.

15
00:02:25,647 --> 00:02:35,577
Planned Meta Muse Spark for dialogue and correction. Planned Muse
Voice Transcribe for optional, reviewed speech-to-text. Both are
disconnected here.

16
00:02:36,053 --> 00:02:43,773
Arjun still has questions. If he chooses, one honest part of his
experience might help someone else feel less alone.

17
00:02:44,553 --> 00:02:52,703
Consent stays unchecked. Nothing is sent unless he chooses. He can
keep or discard this draft; the choice remains his.
